{"id": "R06", "hash": "76beba136fb1", "text": "¿Y en español? Calculamos unos cuarenta y un mil audiolibros, con Penguin Random House y Planeta: García Márquez, Vargas Llosa, Ruiz Zafón, Pérez-Reverte, Posteguillo… Pero todos piden desbloqueo. Sin límites hay solo unos seiscientos en español, como «Crimen y castigo»… abreviado en dos horas. Y algunos usan voz sintética: mira el narrador antes de desbloquear.", "duration": 24.72, "words": [{"w": "¿Y", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.08}, {"w": "en", "s": 0.16, "e": 0.24}, {"w": "español?", "s": 0.32, "e": 1.04}, {"w": "Calculamos", "s": 1.28, "e": 1.84}, {"w": "unos", "s": 1.96, "e": 2.08}, {"w": "cuarenta", "s": 2.24, "e": 2.6}, {"w": "y", "s": 2.64, "e": 2.68}, {"w": "un", "s": 2.72, "e": 2.76}, {"w": "mil", "s": 2.8, "e": 2.96}, {"w": "audiolibros,", "s": 3.08, "e": 4.0}, {"w": "con", "s": 4.08, "e": 4.16}, {"w": "Penguin", "s": 4.24, "e": 4.64}, {"w": "Random", "s": 4.72, "e": 5.04}, {"w": "House", "s": 5.12, "e": 5.44}, {"w": "y", "s": 5.48, "e": 5.52}, {"w": "Planeta:", "s": 5.6, "e": 6.28}, {"w": "García", "s": 6.48, "e": 6.8}, {"w": "Márquez,", "s": 6.88, "e": 7.52}, {"w": "Vargas", "s": 7.6, "e": 7.92}, {"w": "Llosa,", "s": 7.96, "e": 8.56}, {"w": "Ruiz", "s": 8.64, "e": 8.88}, {"w": "Zafón,", "s": 8.92, "e": 9.6}, {"w": "Pérez-Reverte,", "s": 9.64, "e": 10.72}, {"w": "Posteguillo…", "s": 10.84, "e": 11.52}, {"w": "Pero", "s": 11.92, "e": 12.08}, {"w": "todos", "s": 12.24, "e": 12.56}, {"w": "piden", "s": 12.64, "e": 12.88}, {"w": "desbloqueo.", "s": 12.96, "e": 13.84}, {"w": "Sin", "s": 14.08, "e": 14.24}, {"w": "límites", "s": 14.32, "e": 14.72}, {"w": "hay", "s": 14.8, "e": 14.88}, {"w": "solo", "s": 14.96, "e": 15.12}, {"w": "unos", "s": 15.2, "e": 15.44}, {"w": "seiscientos", "s": 15.48, "e": 16.08}, {"w": "en", "s": 16.12, "e": 16.16}, {"w": "español,", "s": 16.24, "e": 17.04}, {"w": "como", "s": 17.2, "e": 17.36}, {"w": "«Crimen", "s": 17.52, "e": 17.84}, {"w": "y", "s": 17.867, "e": 17.893}, {"w": "castigo»…", "s":